  "question": "Which gallery are present within a 140 kilometers limit as I go toward citizens Menlo Park, Menlo Park, CA from Golden Gate Bridge Lookout, Sausalito, CA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.486003 37.82872)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.166705 37.482456)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE tourism = 'gallery'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.486003 37.82872)',4326)::geography, 140000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.486003 37.82872)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
